<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Hardware/Dimensions> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Dimensions generally refer to measurable extents or attributes that define the size, shape, or scale of an object, system, or concept."@en .
